invariant: INV-35
file: src/alert.h
catches: test/lib-check-webpki-tcp-nonblocking.sh
reason: alert.h includes session.h again, an internal header, as it did
  before the public headers stopped holding the library's state. A caller
  that compiles against the API headers alone, with no -Isrc, cannot find
  it, and lib-check's consumer against a copy of API_HEADERS fails.

--- old
#include "session_storage.h"
--- new
#include "session.h"
#include "session_storage.h"
